ly-armored, sturdily-built core drone operated by artillery technicians of the Ursus army. They presage the withering firepower of the Ursus Artillery. The Ursus Artillery is a fire team that has bunkered down into the city. Though packing less firepower than naval guns, their equipment still shreds through buildings and armor with ease.","abilities":["Flying unit."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":16000,"atk":1200,"def":800,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"imperial_striker":{"slug":"imperial_striker","name":"Imperial Striker","icon":"/enemies-icons/Imperial Striker.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The powerful infantry of the Ursus Army, the backbone of the Imperial Army's aggressive advance. They are versatile in offense and defense, melee and ranged. After sustain a certain amount of damage, their morale will peak, causing them to inflict more destruction.","abilities":["Gains significantly increased ATK when HP is under 50%"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":900,"def":800,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4.5}},"emperors_blade_pursuer":{"slug":"emperors_blade_pursuer","name":"'Emperor's Blade', Pursuer","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Emperor's Blade', Pursuer.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"He once ravaged the demons of the Northern Tundra, segregating the outsiders beyond the reach of civilization; His blade shies not from royals nor nobles, safeguarding glory from the dusts of rebellion. Every Royal Guard is as a dominion; the land beneath their feet is all the territory of Ursus.","abilities":["First Form","Whenever a certain percentage of HP is lost,